ng, one-hour guided walking tour.  \n\nJourney into the past as you hear stories about events that took place in the Old State House, Faneuil Hall, King’s Chapel and the Old South Meeting House. Learn about the diverse people, places and events that started a revolution.\n\nThe people of colonial Boston were ordinary people.  Shaped by the times that they lived in, they rose to the cause, and achieved extraordinary things!\n\n## Meeting location:\nMeet your guide near the Samuel Adams statue in front of Faneuil Hall.\n\nFinding Your Guide: All guides carry an 8×11 sign that says “Boston By Foot Walking Tours.”\n\nNearest MBTA Stations: Government Center (Blue & Green Lines) or Haymarket (Orange & Green Lines)\n\n## What to bring\nComfortable shoes, dress for the weather, water bottle", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "The perfect introduction to Boston’s Revolutionary history • 1 Hour", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonbyfoot/items/393810/images/789272/", "pk": 789272, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/0NP6zoDdQRuULQVtDISK", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/0NP6zoDdQRuULQVtDISK", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonbyfoot/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonbyfoot/items/393810/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/0NP6zoDdQRuULQVtDISK", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/0NP6zoDdQRuULQVtDISK", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonbyfoot/items/393810/images/1741238/", "pk": 1741238, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "http